description:
This PowerSchool video tutorial is designed for parents and students, showing how to find grades and comments on assignments. The tutorial covers accessing PowerSchool both from a web browser and the PowerSchool app on a smartphone, making it easy to stay updated on academic progress. Whether you're using a desktop or mobile device, this step-by-step guide will help you navigate PowerSchool with ease.

